*** /data/project/OpenTenBase/src/test/regress/expected/prepared_xacts_1.out	Mon Aug  4 09:42:45 2025
--- /data/project/OpenTenBase/src/test/regress/results/prepared_xacts.out	Mon Sep  1 14:24:24 2025
