! -----------------------------------------------------
!  Remote Subquery Scan on all (datanode_1,datanode_2)
!    ->  Update on t1
!          Update on t1
!          Update on t2
!          Update on t3
!          ->  Seq Scan on t1
!                Filter: (((a % 2) = 0) AND f_leak(b))
!          ->  Seq Scan on t2
!                Filter: (((a % 2) = 0) AND f_leak(b))
!          ->  Seq Scan on t3
!                Filter: (((a % 2) = 0) AND f_leak(b))
! (11 rows)
! 
