!                ->  Merge Full Join
!                      Output: xc_groupby_tab1.val2, xc_groupby_tab2.val2, xc_groupby_tab1.val, xc_groupby_tab2.val
!                      Merge Cond: (xc_groupby_tab1.val2 = xc_groupby_tab2.val2)
